  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喵茸似乎正在对\n蒂安希进化石表示出兴趣。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B583384F3C4E4E6B6357285BF9000A84825B895E0C8FDB531677F38868793A51FA51748DA330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵喵？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B555B5FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喵茸可能\n捕捉到了一些心灵感应。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B5833853EF80FD000A6355634952304E864E004E9B5FC37075611F5E94300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喵茸可以让想法和想法\n互相传达哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B5833853EF4EE58BA960F36CD5548C60F36CD5000A4E9276F84F208FBE54E6300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为太消耗体力了，\n所以我拜托它不要使用这个本领，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但它偶尔还是会像这样捕捉心灵感应。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A592A6D8880174F53529B4E86FF0C000A62404EE5621162DC62585B834E0D89814F7F75288FD94E2A672C9886FF0C00100001BE00000A4F465B8350765C148FD8662F4F1A50CF8FD96837635563495FC37075611F5E94300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "话说我好在意啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n喵茸捕捉到的是\n藏在蒂安希进化石里的想法吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BDD8BF46211597D5728610F554A300200100001BE01000A55B583386355634952307684662F000A85CF572884825B895E0C8FDB531677F391CC768460F36CD55417FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我们跟着喵茸到它要去的地方吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A62114EEC8DDF774055B5833852305B83898153BB7684573065B95427300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喵茸好像感知到什么了呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B58338597D50CF611F77E552304EC04E484E865462300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0B300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喂喂，盖玛？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55825582FF0C76D6739BFF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我和喵茸也正在调查，\n但可能会拜托你们帮忙。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71366211548C55B583384E5F6B6357288C0367E5FF0C000A4F4653EF80FD4F1A62DC62584F604EEC5E2E5FD9300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯，跟艾白尔和\n马尔默也说一声哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF0C8DDF827E767D5C14548C000A9A6C5C149ED84E5F8BF44E0058F054E6300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "抱歉抱歉，我也联系了一下\n一直以来搭档的伙伴。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62B16B4962B16B49FF0C62114E5F80547CFB4E864E004E0B000A4E0076F44EE56765642D686376844F194F34300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一直以来？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0076F44EE56765FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "伙伴？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F194F34FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯，我是第二任所长嘛。\n第一任是个叫做帅哥的人哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF0C6211662F7B2C4E8C4EFB6240957F561B3002000A7B2C4E004EFB662F4E2A53EB505A5E0554E576844EBA54E6300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以才叫帅哥侦探事务所？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5624D53EB5E0554E54FA663A24E8B52A16240FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "事务所名字里的？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8B52A16240540D5B5791CC7684FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没错！他非常温柔，\n还教我读书写字之类的……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA19519FF014ED6975E5E386E2967D4FF0C000A8FD8655962118BFB4E6651995B574E4B7C7B76842026202600100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但因为他是个国际警察，\n为解决事件去了很远的地方。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4656E04E3A4ED6662F4E2A56FD96458B665BDFFF0C000A4E3A89E351B34E8B4EF653BB4E865F888FDC7684573065B9300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以呢，靠着刚才提到的伙伴\n还有喵茸的帮助，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我才勉强当着第二任所长。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55462FF0C97607740521A624D63D0523076844F194F34000A8FD8670955B5833876845E2E52A9FF0C00100001BE00000A6211624D52C95F3A5F5377407B2C4E8C4EFB6240957F300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "特别是喵茸的心灵感应相当厉害，\n多亏它这个本领，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我们才解决了好多疑难事件！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7279522B662F55B5833876845FC37075611F5E9476F85F5353895BB3FF0C000A591A4E8F5B838FD94E2A672C9886FF0C00100001BE00000A62114EEC624D89E351B34E86597D591A759196BE4E8B4EF6FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但就像我刚才说的，\n用太多的话，它会累坏的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F465C3150CF6211521A624D8BF47684FF0C000A7528592A591A76848BDDFF0C5B834F1A7D2F574F7684300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵喵？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B555B5FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我们也追上去吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A62114EEC4E5F8FFD4E0A53BB5427FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喵茸，莫非你感知了我的心情？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B58338FF0C83AB975E4F60611F77E54E86621176845FC360C5FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大概是喵茸的力量……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59276982662F55B583387684529B91CF202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "玛琪艾儿的想法\n在脑中浮现出来了……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n………………\n………………<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n喵茸它到底怎么了？\n话说肚子好饿啊～<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n………………\n………………",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "玛琪艾儿？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "739B742A827E513FFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你肚子饿了？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60809A5B50997F4E86FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘿嘿，感觉肚子有点饿～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "563F563FFF0C611F89C9809A5B50670970B9997FFF5E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你，喵茸。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C224F60FF0C55B58338300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，来补充燃料吧～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C67658865514571C365995427FF5E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太好吃了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A597D54034E86FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好啦，喵茸，\n告诉我你想去哪里吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D5566FF0C55B58338FF0C000A544A8BC962114F6060F353BB54EA91CC5427300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵喵？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B555B5FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我们也追上去吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A62114EEC4E5F8FFD4E0A53BB5427FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喵茸，你为什么在\n全息传送梯前停下了？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B58338FF0C4F604E3A4EC04E485728000A5168606F4F20900168AF524D505C4E0B4E86FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵喵。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
