      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来快到了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67655FEB52304E86300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我们先去上面等你哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A62114EEC514853BB4E0A97627B494F6054E6FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿4",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这里就是喵茸\n感知到什么的地方吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD991CC5C31662F55B58338000A611F77E552304EC04E487684573065B95427FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超级结晶也太多了吧？\n怎么看都很反常。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D857EA77ED366764E5F592A591A4E865427FF1F000A600E4E48770B90FD5F8853CD5E38300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵喵～喵！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B555B5FF5E55B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "小碎钻……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0F788E94BB2026202600100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "另一只宝可梦是？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 2752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E64E0053EA5B9D53EF68A6662FFF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也许和你的\n超级石有什么关系？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 2780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F8BB8548C4F607684000A8D857EA777F367094EC04E4851737CFBFF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 2820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "试着捕捉一下来确认\n是不是和超级石有关吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BD57740635563494E004E0B6765786E8BA4000A662F4E0D662F548C8D857EA777F3670951735427FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵喵～咪。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 2884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B555B5FF5E54AA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 2900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蒂啊！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 2912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8482554AFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿A",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "必须捉到它！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 2936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5FC5987B634952305B83FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "必须捉到而不是打倒它！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5FC5987B63495230800C4E0D662F625350125B83FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "恭喜！\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>你果然厉害啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "606D559CFF01000A00100002010000004F60679C713653895BB3554A300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那个，<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n让我看看刚才的宝可梦嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E2AFF0C0010000201000000FF0C000A8BA96211770B770B521A624D76845B9D53EF68A6561B300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好漂亮……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 3084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D6F024EAE20262026FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它的光芒会让我\n回忆起百刻日晷！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 3108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B837684514982924F1A8BA96211000A56DE5FC68D77767E523B65E56677FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "百刻？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "767E523BFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "日晷？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 3160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E56677FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯，在百刻市这个地方\n有神秘的日晷哦。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n据说是和超级石有关联的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 3168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF0C5728767E523B5E028FD94E2A573065B9000A6709795E79D8768465E5667754E6300200100001BE00000A636E8BF4662F548C8D857EA777F36709517380547684300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真是让人回想连篇啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F662F8BA94EBA56DE60F38FDE7BC7554A300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其实啊，\n帅哥不在了以后<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我也认识了一些人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 3280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51765B9E554AFF0C000A5E0554E54E0D57284E864EE5540E00100001BE00000A62114E5F8BA48BC64E864E004E9B4EBA300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一个是AZ，\n另一个是布拉塔诺博士。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 3340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E004E2A662F0041005AFF0C000A53E64E004E2A662F5E0362C958548BFA535A58EB300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那位博士是研究超级进化的专家，\n他和AZ也这么说过……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 3388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34F4D535A58EB662F78147A768D857EA78FDB531676844E135BB6FF0C000A4ED6548C0041005A4E5F8FD94E488BF48FC72026202600100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "3000年前发射的\n最终兵器的光芒……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n超级石或许是沐浴了传说的\n宝可梦之力的石头变成的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00330030003000305E74524D53D15C047684000A67007EC8517556687684514982922026202600100001BE01000A8D857EA777F362168BB8662F6C906D744E864F208BF47684000A5B9D53EF68A64E4B529B768477F3593453D862107684300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "AZ对此也点了点头。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n他说正因如此最近才会\n发现新种类的超级石。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 3560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041005A5BF96B644E5F70B94E8670B95934300200100001BE01000A4ED68BF46B6356E059826B6467008FD1624D4F1A000A53D173B065B079CD7C7B76848D857EA777F3300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……毕竟，最终兵器\n在5年前也被使用了啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 3640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620266BD57ADFFF0C67007EC851755668000A572800355E74524D4E5F88AB4F7F75284E86554A300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茸喵……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 3692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "833855B5202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喵茸，你放心哦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n密阿雷有<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā他她在，\n而且还有我在呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 3704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B58338FF0C4F60653E5FC354E6300200100001BE01000A5BC6963F96F76709001000020100000000100003110000FF01014ED659795728FF0C000A800C4E148FD86709621157285462FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n你也要好好照顾这只宝可梦哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 84,
      "offsetInSection": 3792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A4F604E5F8981597D597D7167987E8FD953EA5B9D53EF68A654E6300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你能和各种各样的宝可梦们结缘，\n密阿雷太需要像你这样的人啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 3844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6080FD548C540479CD5404683776845B9D53EF68A64EEC7ED37F18FF0C000A5BC6963F96F7592A9700898150CF4F608FD9683776844EBA5566300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那～我们就回\n帅哥侦探事务所咯。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 3916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3FF5E62114EEC5C3156DE000A5E0554E54FA663A24E8B52A1624054AF300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对了！AZ他还跟我说过这件事……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 3960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E86FF010041005A4ED68FD88DDF62118BF48FC78FD94EF64E8B2026202600100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在寻找花叶蒂的漫长旅途中，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n他在遥远的丰缘地区\n还看到了可以称为<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n超级进化起源的现象！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 4004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57285BFB627E82B153F6848276846F2B957F65C590144E2DFF0C00100001BE01000A4ED6572890658FDC76844E307F185730533A000A8FD8770B52304E8653EF4EE579F04E3A00100001BE00000A8D857EA78FDB53168D776E90768473B08C61FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以说AZ他啊，\n一直～都在思考<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n宝可梦和人类的牵绊呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 4112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE58BF40041005A4ED6554AFF0C000A4E0076F4FF5E90FD5728601D800300100001BE00000A5B9D53EF68A6548C4EBA7C7B768472757ECA5462300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n之后有什么事也请多指教咯！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n再见啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 4184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A4E4B540E67094EC04E484E8B4E5F8BF7591A6307655954AFFF0100100001BE01000A518D89C15566FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    }
  ],
